details = "Lv.1 baseline:
Active: blink up to 320px.
Cooldown: 4.0s.
Mark lasts 6.0s and empowers 1 attack.
+1 marked attack per 2 ranks above Lv.1, up to 5.
Bonus damage: 3× your attack damage.
Damage gains +35% of its Lv.1 value per rank.
10% chance to refund the cooldown."
